# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# State directory for the persistent (CoW-tree) storage backend. The unit's
# StateDirectory= already creates this on start; the entry here makes the
# directory exist immediately after package install, so an operator can stage
# a cache file before first start.
#
# Type Path                 Mode Owner      Group      Age Argument
d      /var/lib/pace-kv  0750 pace-kv pace-kv -   -
